=== (3) pair channel: first moment of F^{0x}_pair is nonzero, but [B,P]=0 since pi(k)+pi(-k)=0 ===
G m=1.0: max|b(k)| (pair part of M_xx) = 2.061e-01; max|pi(k)+pi(-k)| = 4.2e-15 -> [B,P_x] = 0
G m=0.3: max|b(k)| (pair part of M_xx) = 2.451e-01; max|pi(k)+pi(-k)| = 4.2e-15 -> [B,P_x] = 0
L m=1.0: max|b(k)| (pair part of M_xx) = 2.452e+00; max|pi(k)+pi(-k)| = 3.3e-10 -> [B,P_x] = 0
L m=0.3: max|b(k)| (pair part of M_xx) = 4.015e+00; max|pi(k)+pi(-k)| = 3.3e-10 -> [B,P_x] = 0

=== (4) sawtooth escape: raw Fourier coefficients of the momentum symbol (nothing subtracted) ===
sawtooth (exact crystal momentum)    |c_n| at n=10,50,200,1000: 1.00e-01, 2.00e-02, 5.00e-03, 1.01e-03
                                     integral of (Pi'-1) over the zone (periodic difference, jump included) = -6.2832 (expect -2pi = -6.2832); anomaly set measure = 0.0004
smoothed sawtooth delta=0.5          |c_n| at n=10,50,200,1000: 4.94e-02, 3.80e-04, 3.88e-09, 1.30e-16
                                     integral of (Pi'-1) over the zone (periodic difference, jump included) = -6.2832 (expect -2pi = -6.2832); anomaly set measure = 0.9561
smoothed sawtooth delta=0.1          |c_n| at n=10,50,200,1000: 8.68e-02, 1.10e-02, 1.72e-04, 4.61e-10
                                     integral of (Pi'-1) over the zone (periodic difference, jump included) = -6.2832 (expect -2pi = -6.2832); anomaly set measure = 0.1921
G: u'/2 at m=0.3                     |c_n| at n=10,50,200,1000: 4.70e-04, 6.43e-06, 5.27e-11, 2.14e-19
                                     integral of (Pi'-1) over the zone (periodic difference, jump included) = -6.2832 (expect -2pi = -6.2832); anomaly set measure = 2.1648
sawtooth n*|c_n| at n=10,100,1000: [np.float64(1.0), np.float64(1.0001), np.float64(1.0062)] (=1 -> |c_n| = 1/n, 1/r tail along each axis)

